# Browser verification — map stacking context (Fix 2)

Date: 2026-10-22. App: http://localhost:3000 (dev). Batch detail page
/marketplace/1fd8e6b0-529a-425a-b1fd-29504bd33243 (Leaflet route map).

## Computed style (live DOM)

wrapperClass: "relative isolate h-[320px] w-full overflow-hidden border border-wesup-ink/15"
computed isolation: "isolate"

The wrapper is the element directly above `.leaflet-container`; the map now
creates its own stacking context, so the 1000+ z-index Leaflet panes cannot
paint over the sticky navigation.

